{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんにちは☀️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "四期生の目黒陽色（めぐろひいろ）です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "蝉の声を聞いて目が覚める朝。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これぞ夏だな〜って感じるよね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "キラキラした日差し、入道雲、夏の匂い。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "大大だーいすきな夏だけど、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今年の夏はいつもより一味も二味も違って見えて、　、　。🍧"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobzuAQbC.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobPxLVBv.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobgcDhdX.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "京都リアルミート&グリート🌹"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "会いに来てくださったみなさん❕\nありがとうございました♡"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "とってもかわいい祝花がたくさん嬉しかったな♡"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私の好きを詰め込んでくれたような、お花たちにしばらくうっとりしてたよ。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "沢山思い出写真に納めたんだ〜📷✨\nありがとう。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ミーグリの後って、いつも余韻に浸る時間があって、\n帰りの車だったり、新幹線に乗りながら、「あの言葉嬉しかったな」とか、「あの時の表情かわいかったな」とか、みんなのことを思い返しては、1人でもう一回にやにやしてる。笑"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "でも同時に、「あの時もっとこんなこと言えたな〜」「こう返せてたらもっとよかったかも」って、1人反省会をしてることも結構あるんだよね。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんなふうにあとから思い返すのって、もしかしたらみんなも同じだったりするのかな〜💭なんて"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "もしそうだったら、なんかうれしい。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あの時間って、その場で終わるんじゃなくて、お互いの帰り道とか、寝る前とかにふと思い出したりして、もう一回あったかい気持ちになれる時間なんだなって思う。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "また次に会えた時は、その続きを一緒に話そうね🌱"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobzqOGlc.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "7月20日に誕生日を迎えて、18歳になったももちゃん🍑🎂"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いやー18とは思えない大人っぽさの浴衣姿にきゅんですね。これは❤︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "2コマ漫画📖　いとちゃん編"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "陽「よいしょと。自撮りしよーっと。」"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ん？あれ　誰かがこっちを見ている？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobY1bvcD.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ﾄｺﾄｺ。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ぴょん！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mob2IXSfC.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いとちゃんでした☺︎\nかわいすぎてくるしぃ（ ;  ; ）❕\n普段はとっても頼りになる先輩で尊敬してます✨"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobjvcBz7.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "天さん👼♡"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ほんとうにいつでも、どこでも、何をしても、可愛くてかっこいい天さん。お団子ヘアがとっーっても似合ってました♡"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "初GIGA❕"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今回初めて参加させていただきました。\n最っ高に楽しくて、あつーいフェスでした☀️\nBuddiesさいこう！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobTVUmdE.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobz3tBzA.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最後まで読んでくれてありがとうございます❕"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ツアーに、フェスにミーグリに。\nこの夏は忘れられない思い出になるだろうな🎐"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "明後日には広島公演1日目。\n一緒に思いっきり楽しみましょう！！😚♪"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "🎧「KissHug」 - aiko"}], "source": "official"}